      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-10T08:21:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "8 sku looks safer and more deterministic: you could use a bit in the skuid to determine which sensors you are using.\nThis code assumes the sensor has \"booted\" when EC is running. \n- That may not be true depending on the power domain. (from .active_mask, it seems the sensors are powered off in S5).\n- If the sensor is a little slow (see driver/accel_kionix.c init() function).",
      "parentUuid": "cc23b023_852469e7",
      "revId": "8fc98f0ba30c87c702381862562430e29e686632",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
